<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Game said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intl Game said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded International Game Technology to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 22-7/8 Thursday.</p>
